TABLE {'table_order': 10, 'start_byte': 584980, 'end_byte': 654520, 'structure_path': ['html:1', 'body:1', 'div:320', 'table:1'], 'span_sha256': '7e320f35cb9ee40d84faf2cf4c10ad8302d5f7cc8ff1129e8d135650e21b492a'}
BEFORE
{'start_byte': 556024, 'end_byte': 556891, 'tag': 'div', 'attributes': [['style', 'margin-top:9pt;text-indent:22.5pt']], 'inside_table': False, 'structure_path': ['html:1', 'body:1', 'div:307'], 'visible_text': 'Our system grew from 9,361 properties (1,706,331 rooms) at year-end 2024 to 9,805 properties (1,779,936 rooms) at year-end 2025. The increase compared to year-end 2024 reflected gross additions of 703 properties (99,459 rooms), including the addition of 37 properties (8,789 rooms) from the citizenM brand acquisition discussed in Note 3, and deletions of 253 properties (25,643 rooms). The property and room counts as of year-end 2025 reflect the removal of all Sonder properties from our portfolio. Our 2025 gross room additions included nearly 64,000 rooms located outside U.S. & Canada (including the citizenM brand acquisition) and roughly 33,400 rooms converted from competitor brands.', 'span_sha256': '1093e426c39a3b932d1ed6dd6bc1215ce513590fa66e7b94d12dcf7545a2aa60'}
{'start_byte': 556891, 'end_byte': 557546, 'tag': 'div', 'attributes': [['style', 'margin-top:9pt;text-indent:22.5pt']], 'inside_table': False, 'structure_path': ['html:1', 'body:1', 'div:308'], 'visible_text': 'At year-end 2025, we had approximately 4,100 properties and nearly 610,000 rooms in our development pipeline, which included over 35,000 rooms approved for development but not yet under signed contracts. At year-end 2025, our development pipeline included nearly 265,000 rooms, or 43 percent, that were under construction, including hotels that are in the process of converting to our system. Over half of the rooms in our development pipeline were located outside U.S. & Canada.', 'span_sha256': '4810d9637b3c51867d8c633c337d79e95d60c1a8564f34a7c66aa44b29e93c61'}
{'start_byte': 557546, 'end_byte': 558382, 'tag': 'div', 'attributes': [['style', 'margin-top:9pt;text-indent:22.5pt']], 'inside_table': False, 'structure_path': ['html:1', 'body:1', 'div:309'], 'visible_text': 'In 2025, we signed nearly 1,200 development deals with hotel owners and other counterparties (excluding the citizenM acquisition) representing approximately 163,000 rooms globally. Over 30 percent of rooms signed were driven by conversion opportunities. During 2025, we added three new brands to our portfolio through the citizenM brand acquisition and the introductions of Series by Marriott and the Outdoor Collection by Marriott Bonvoy. We continued to expand our portfolio across chain scales, including advancing the expansion of our midscale offerings, and we also continued to strengthen our residential portfolio, signing 55 residential agreements in 2025.', 'span_sha256': '2f8f0db0edc3697dcfbf6b9e9e500e6c6e59d0f79f526c8aedab72738d805b4e'}
{'start_byte': 558382, 'end_byte': 558612, 'tag': 'div', 'attributes': [['style', 'margin-top:9pt;text-indent:22.5pt']], 'inside_table': False, 'structure_path': ['html:1', 'body:1', 'div:310'], 'visible_text': 'In 2026, we expect net rooms growth of 4.5 to 5.0 percent.', 'span_sha256': '678688fc470e120213e99cdaf46f113d4c4931a187af123035f8453b85a84e03'}
{'start_byte': 558666, 'end_byte': 558839, 'tag': 'div', 'attributes': [['style', 'margin-top:9pt']], 'inside_table': False, 'structure_path': ['html:1', 'body:1', 'div:312'], 'visible_text': 'Properties and Rooms', 'span_sha256': '4c92565cd98e577ca7c2a4266946ffca6ca62f2789cd6162660c38b1c45a4155'}
{'start_byte': 558839, 'end_byte': 559080, 'tag': 'div', 'attributes': [['style', 'margin-top:9pt;text-indent:22.5pt']], 'inside_table': False, 'structure_path': ['html:1', 'body:1', 'div:313'], 'visible_text': 'The following table shows our properties and rooms by ownership type.', 'span_sha256': '4dbe1eaafec6dbbb0dd9e5b477f4ba19dea726fdf19c97e8d850f96ff1c586c3'}
{'start_byte': 582589, 'end_byte': 583146, 'tag': 'div', 'attributes': [['style', 'margin-bottom:9pt;margin-top:3pt;padding-left:36pt;text-indent:-18pt']], 'inside_table': False, 'structure_path': ['html:1', 'body:1', 'div:315'], 'visible_text': '(1)Licensed and other properties include our timeshare properties, MGM Collection with Marriott Bonvoy, Design Hotels, and The Ritz-Carlton Yacht Collection.', 'span_sha256': '810726f5922ab1feb2dc6979d6bbd809686766bcf2605b294f1af24bff8f9afe'}
